# OpenRazer 3.12.4: recover stale/torn 00c3 receiver reads and propagate errors.
# Resend only the six tested read-only queries, at most three attempts, under
# the device mutex. Never replay setters. See DRIVER.md for hardware evidence.
# Applied after the polling, power and DPI patches.
--- a/driver/razercommon.c
+++ b/driver/razercommon.c
@@ -65,7 +65,7 @@
